#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: segurium.php
msgid ""
"Segurium – Free Malware Removal & Antivirus Scanner, Hacked Website Cleanup,"
" Firewall, 2FA"
msgstr ""
"Segurium – Free Malware Removal & Antivirus Scanner, Hacked Website Cleanup,"
" Firewall, 2FA"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: segurium.php
msgid "https://segurium.com"
msgstr "https://segurium.com"

#. Description of the plugin
#: segurium.php
msgid ""
"Website hacked? Free malware removal and antivirus scan for WordPress: clean"
" infected files, restore them. Firewall, brute force, 2FA included."
msgstr ""
"Hacket websted? Gratis fjernelse af malware og antivirusscanning til "
"WordPress: rens inficerede filer, og gendan dem. Firewall, brute force og "
"2FA følger med."

